<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px3" title="In 6 Limitations and Future work ‣ Test-Time Warmup for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">GRPO + online auxiliary task generation</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px4" title="In 6 Limitations and Future work ‣ Test-Time Warmup for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Process supervision metric</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px5" title="In 6 Limitations and Future work ‣ Test-Time Warmup for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Diverse set of reasoning tasks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px6" title="In 6 Limitations and Future work ‣ Test-Time Warmup for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Optimal set of auxiliary tasks</span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_paragraph"><a href="#S6.SS0.SSS0.Px7" title="In 6 Limitations and Future work ‣ Test-Time Warmup for Multimodal Large Language Models" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title">Test-Time Warmup towards AI Safety</span></a></li>
</ol></li>
